---
title: Pasta Bolognese
servings: 4
tags:
  - italian
  - pasta
  - classic
---

= Soffritto

Heat @olive oil{2%tbsp} in a #large saucepan{}. Add @onion{1}, @carrot{1}, and @celery stalk{1}, all finely diced. Cook over medium heat for ~{10%minutes} until softened.

= Meat Sauce

Add @minced beef{500%g} and cook until browned, breaking up any lumps. Pour in @dry white wine{120%ml} and cook for ~{3%minutes} until evaporated.

Stir in @canned tomatoes{400%g} and @tomato paste{1%tbsp}. Season with @salt{} and @black pepper{}. Reduce heat and simmer for ~{45%minutes}.

= Pasta

Cook @spaghetti{400%g} in a #large pot{} of salted boiling water until al dente.

Drain and toss with the bolognese sauce. Serve with @parmesan cheese{} grated on top.
